{
  "item": "gambler_moss",
  "mu_name": "Moss the Gambler",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/gambler_moss.bmd, loaded as MODEL_GAMBLE_NPC_MOSS (ZzzOpenData.cpp:2169-2171, its textures out of Npc\\), MuMain's MONSTER_MOSS_THE_MERCHANT, type 492 (_enum.h:4820, ZzzCharacter.cpp:14847-14860); MONSTER_WANDERING_MERCHANT_ZYRO wears the same body (ZzzCharacter.cpp:14507-14517). Elbeland's gambler in later seasons. Not Version075's.",
  "world": "noria",
  "object_type": -1,
  "why_this_one": "The Jeweler: the user's pick on 2026-10-20 from four unused MU NPCs (\"Moss the Gambler is nice\"), for the ring and pendant window (Recut, Salvage, Combine). An old man in a tricorn with a pipe, among crates, a barrel and treasure chests of weapons: 12 sheets, 57 bones, 7 actions. His spot is proposed as Noria's east market, about 197,114; the placement is the user's to confirm.",
  "scale": 0.8,
  "scale_from": "CreateCharacter stands him at `c->Object.Scale = 0.8f` (ZzzCharacter.cpp:14852), MU's own; carried as the figure's scale, as Liane's 0.95 is.",
  "actions_from": "Seven actions exported (export-rig --actions=all). MoveCharacter's MODEL_GAMBLE_NPC_MOSS case (ZzzCharacter.cpp:3640-3648) plays action 0, and action 1 one time in five, never twice running.",
  "play_speed_from": "CreateCharacter sets PlaySpeed 0.33 on his first six actions (ZzzCharacter.cpp:14855-14858). Not carried: a townsperson's clips are exported at export_gltf's flat 0.25, as Tersia's note says.",
  "effects_from": "RenderObjectMesh's MODEL_GAMBLE_NPC_MOSS case (ZzzObject.cpp:2293-2308): every frame a BITMAP_SMOKELINE1-3 and a BITMAP_CLUD64 particle at bone 41 (his pipe), light 0.8, scale 0.6; and a BITMAP_LIGHT sprite at bone 55, size 2.0, light 0.5. Not drawn yet.",
  "profile": "npc",
  "sheets": {
    "gambman": "npc_gambman.png",
    "GBnotB": "npc_gbnotb.png",
    "GBnotA": "npc_gbnota.png",
    "treasure_chest": "npc_treasure_chest.png",
    "drums": "npc_drums.png",
    "phbox01": "npc_phbox01.png",
    "gamble_wand": "npc_gamble_wand.png",
    "GBctB_R": "npc_gbctb_r.png",
    "phbox02": "npc_phbox02.png",
    "gamble_stick": "npc_gamble_stick.png",
    "gamblestick_R": "npc_gamblestick_r.png",
    "GBctA": "npc_gbcta.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Out of Data/NPC of the S17 client (third_party/MuClient_S17_v1.19.74), beside the model, decoded under an npc_ prefix, lower case. All twelve are .OZJ: no alpha.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "gambman": "skin",
    "GBnotB": "painted_steel",
    "GBnotA": "blade_steel",
    "treasure_chest": "hardwood",
    "drums": "plank",
    "phbox01": "plank",
    "gamble_wand": "brass",
    "GBctB_R": "lamplight",
    "phbox02": "plank",
    "gamble_stick": "brass",
    "gamblestick_R": "lamplight",
    "GBctA": "steel"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "gambman is the one page of his face, coat, waistcoat and boots, so skin, as every townsperson's shared page is. GBnotB is the teal scythe's fittings, painted metal; GBnotA its silver blades. treasure_chest the chests' wood and gilt bands, drums the barrel's staves, phbox01 and phbox02 the crates. gamble_wand the serpent staff and gamble_stick the gold staff, brass. GBctA is the weapons in the chests, steel. GBctB_R (a blue crystal) and gamblestick_R (a magenta rune) are _R sheets, drawn added.",
  "glow": {
    "GBctB_R": {},
    "gamblestick_R": {}
  },
  "glow_from": "The two _R sheets, drawn added, as the Archangel's ju01_R and Liane's eyeglas_R are. His own case draws the body once, RENDER_TEXTURE (ZzzObject.cpp:2308).",
  "islands_from": "The build fills this.",
